  vocab: 'Word memory and Journey word cards; label things at home with the Arabic word (fridge, door, bag).',
  reading: 'Read-along stories: let the app read first, then your child reads aloud. Ask one question about the story.',
  listening: 'Listen & tap rounds; play Arabic cartoons or songs in the car and pause to ask "what did they say?".',
  spelling: 'Dictation game with the slow voice; then write 3 words on the whiteboard from memory.',
